Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请问...  你是在拍电车吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}啊  对  这是我的爱好\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我想问一件事  这里怎么走\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能拿过来看看吗  请问是哪个方向\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯  那边\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳是要走过去吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}坐车\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}指路中……\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我知道了  谢谢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.39,0:01:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个  是工作的事情吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要去参加甄选会  第一次来不认识路\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳是模特吗  还是艺人\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能告诉我妳的名字吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.77,0:02:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}爱乃娜美\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.45,0:02:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请妳好好加油啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}说完她就走向停在路边的白色轿车 我恋恋不舍地看着她穿着黑色连裤袜的长腿和妩媚的背影走进那辆车...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.05,0:02:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}夜晚\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我和往常一样  正拿着摄像机在街上溜达  却看见一个女孩蹲在路边\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.15,0:03:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.19,0:03:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳好像醉了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳不是之前那个…\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个…\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个向我问路的那个模特小姐吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳还记得我吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不记得了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}喝多了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:04:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不舒服吗  要喝点水吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.81,0:04:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要回家了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}小心点  妳连路都走不好\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要是可以的话  我家离这里很近 去我家休息一下吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳这个样子一个人回家很危险的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳家就在附近吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很近\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}在哪啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就在那里\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}但是妳一个女孩…\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.37,0:04:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:05:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}总之妳先来我家喝点水休息一下再回去好吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}对了  你干嘛老拿着摄影机\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个... 这是我的爱好 刚才也是在拍附近的景色\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳今天真喝了那么多吗  很危险的  明明是个女孩子  喝成那样  会发生什么事都不知道\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这里就是我家  有点破旧  能上来吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没关系\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:06:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}扶着我  抓紧一点\N
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳稍等一下  我拿钥匙\N
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}快请进\N
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.43,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我去拿水给妳\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事  就蹲在那里吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}等我脱个外套\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不是什么好杯子  请将就一下…\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}拿在手上喝吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我帮妳把外套脱下来吧  会弄皱的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事  就坐着脱吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天真的喝了那么多吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很多\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}冷吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很冷\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以吗  把外套脱下来…\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:09:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧  再喝点水吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}但...  但是这样的话\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.60,0:09:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那样睡觉很难受的  我这里有被子\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}等等  等等\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样睡的话会很难受的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要是妳打算睡这的话  先垫上这个枕头\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}她躺在地上 好像一条身姿优美的美人鱼 我的下面此时已经硬的很厉害了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没关系吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还有什么需要吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.39,0:10:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要紧吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要紧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要水吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.21,0:10:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:11:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个...给\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要紧了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可是...  水可以醒酒的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不喝\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.38,0:11:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能听见我的声音吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}该怎么办才好...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳的身材好棒\N
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好可爱\N
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好棒\N
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.21,0:30:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}早上好\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.67,0:30:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}睡得好吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.53,0:30:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}为什么你要拿着摄像机\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.48,0:30:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我很不擅长和女孩子说话 只有拿着摄像机的时候才能…不可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.42,0:30:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.50,0:30:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以拿着吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.22,0:30:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.36,0:30:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}昨天...  昨天的事情妳还记得吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.25,0:31:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不怎么记得了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.62,0:31:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是我在路边发现了妳...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.97,0:31:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个我记得\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.56,0:31:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你来到我家以后就睡着了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}身体没关系吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.78,0:31:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}感觉很恶心\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.87,0:31:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个...  我做了早饭妳要吃吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.68,0:31:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}身体不舒服  不想吃\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.80,0:31:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不过妳看上去身体很虚  我特地为妳准备的...  至少吃两口吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.82,0:31:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳喜欢日本菜吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.93,0:31:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}喜欢是喜欢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.30,0:31:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那...  那真是太好了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.50,0:32:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这些都是你做的吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.21,0:32:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是我好不容易做的  尝尝吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.21,0:32:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可是我有胃有点恶心\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.04,0:32:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那就喝点味增汤吧...  不和胃口吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.85,0:32:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好啦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.81,0:32:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的就只喝一口啊...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还有烤鱼和昨天做的牛肉炖土豆...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.06,0:32:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}身体不舒服不想吃\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.28,0:32:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是吗...  怎么办才好啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.21,0:32:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}话说都已经11点了啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.49,0:33:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}有什么事吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.74,0:33:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还要去摄影\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不能留下来吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.18,0:33:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}来不及了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.36,0:33:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的要走了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.71,0:33:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个...  等等\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.46,0:33:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要是可以的话  还能让我见到妳吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.57,0:33:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要是帮我开车  拎行李什么的  倒是可以考虑一下\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.86,0:33:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我什么都愿意做  能让我再见到妳吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.50,0:33:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我会考虑的哦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.14,0:33:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}会考虑吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.65,0:33:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.30,0:33:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好了  要走了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.97,0:33:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好  工作好好加油啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.78,0:34:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}过了一段时间  她终于联系我了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.90,0:34:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不好意思我来晚了一点\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.95,0:34:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你好慢啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.33,0:34:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天有什么事...  是要我拎东西吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.74,0:34:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯  在这里\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.60,0:34:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}诶  这些东西妳一个人不就可以了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.03,0:34:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要  我可拎不动\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.18,0:34:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}快点快点\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}都买了这么些今天已经够了吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.92,0:34:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我还要买呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.72,0:34:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还要买吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.65,0:34:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.67,0:34:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还要买什么啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.60,0:34:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不知道\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.18,0:34:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这件可爱吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.61,0:34:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳觉得呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.27,0:34:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我觉得挺可爱的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.47,0:34:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这件怎么样\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.49,0:34:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这个感觉颜色有点亮丽\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可是我觉得还不错啊  哪件好呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.46,0:34:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}但是...  我觉得妳穿什么都好看\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那再去附近逛逛吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.15,0:35:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还...  还要继续买吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.65,0:35:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再逛一会吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.83,0:35:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这个还不错\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.58,0:35:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这个挺方便的  可以放一些换洗的衣服  书本  散碎的东西之类的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.88,0:35:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那还挺方便的啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.10,0:35:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}抱歉  我来晚了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.18,0:35:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真慢啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.57,0:35:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天又喝酒了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.95,0:35:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}喝了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.19,0:35:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}现在要回去吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.74,0:35:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要去哪啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.34,0:35:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯...  我还要喝酒\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.26,0:35:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我还没喝够呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.25,0:35:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可是妳路都走不稳了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.46,0:35:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没事  没事\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.26,0:35:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}对了  你是不是很会烧菜啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.37,0:35:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我也就会做点早饭\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.19,0:35:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯  那就做吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.37,0:35:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那要做什么\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.55,0:35:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}下酒菜  下酒菜\N
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.57,0:36:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳的意思是...  去我家喝酒\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.11,0:36:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.11,0:36:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳还好吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.13,0:36:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.16,0:36:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.61,0:36:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}总之妳先喝点水吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.13,0:36:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}谢谢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.52,0:36:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我能坐在妳旁边吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.27,0:36:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以哦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.45,0:36:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天喝了很多吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.68,0:36:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不多不少吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.09,0:36:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}和上次喝的一样多吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.57,0:36:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还是很醉吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}只有一点点\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.50,0:36:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}一点点吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.98,0:36:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我能坐的离妳更近点吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.95,0:37:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.24,0:37:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能再近点吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.31,0:37:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.85,0:37:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}靠在我身上....  行吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.70,0:37:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}为什么呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.92,0:37:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就一会...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.55,0:37:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}也不是不行\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.63,0:37:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}下酒菜呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.78,0:37:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我马上就做\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.08,0:37:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我马上就去做了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.29,0:37:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}住手\N
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.62,0:38:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我叫你住手啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.74,0:38:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我马上就去做下酒菜\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.72,0:38:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你摸我胸部了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.53,0:38:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我没摸\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.35,0:38:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要回去了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.74,0:38:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请妳别回去  求妳了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.27,0:38:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我再也不敢了  不敢了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.99,0:38:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}抱歉\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.30,0:38:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我去做下酒菜\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.78,0:38:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳要吃什么啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.76,0:38:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}先来点枝豆吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.50,0:38:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没有那个诶...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.71,0:38:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那有什么\N
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.92,0:39:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}老实说  什么材料也没有\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.02,0:39:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}什么啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.85,0:39:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不好意思\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.68,0:39:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么开口好呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.65,0:39:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不愿意再靠在我身上了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.83,0:39:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你就那么想和我做爱吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.69,0:39:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳这么漂亮  又这么可爱\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.31,0:39:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以这样吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.97,0:40:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这个...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.92,0:40:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.70,0:40:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样摸的话...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.38,0:40:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳不生气了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.33,0:40:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我不生气啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.26,0:40:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}糟糕\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.49,0:40:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.35,0:40:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我没什么经验...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.48,0:40:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这个\N
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.15,0:41:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好难为情啊...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.82,0:41:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要脱下来咯\N
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.32,0:41:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好难为情\N
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.59,0:41:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你内裤已经被湿了哦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.84,0:41:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}被妳这么弄的啦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.28,0:42:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.77,0:42:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这让人很难为情啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.47,0:42:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}竟然有这种事情...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.84,0:43:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这个...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.76,0:43:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}如何  舒服吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.65,0:43:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.32,0:44:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}妳喜欢这样玩弄我吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.21,0:44:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我也想摸妳  让我摸摸吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.64,0:44:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行\N
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.81,0:44:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}为什么  不许我碰妳吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.73,0:45:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}来 吧内裤脱掉吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.18,0:45:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好爽\N
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.35,0:46:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以两只脚一起来吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.74,0:46:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}两只脚一起感觉更爽\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.31,0:46:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我受不了了 让我摸摸你吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.73,0:46:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.98,0:46:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}为什么  不让我碰妳吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.59,0:46:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我忍不住了 让我摸一下吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.70,0:46:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.94,0:46:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就摸一下\N
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.79,0:46:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行\N
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.02,0:47:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.51,0:47:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}舔这里\N
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.45,0:48:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}来舔阴蒂\N
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.46,0:48:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想舔我的奶子吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.46,0:49:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我想舔\N
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.55,0:49:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}给你\N
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.74,0:49:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}含着我的奶头\N
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.16,0:50:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我也想你舔舔我的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.08,0:50:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要我帮你舔吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.46,0:50:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真拿你没办法\N
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.46,0:50:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请温柔一点\N
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.15,0:50:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}温柔的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.76,0:50:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请你让我舒服吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.99,0:51:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好厉害\N
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.71,0:51:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好柔好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.26,0:51:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}龟头好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.85,0:51:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.79,0:51:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}变得好硬了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.26,0:52:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.46,0:52:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这里好敏感哦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.40,0:52:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.47,0:52:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好刺激\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.46,0:53:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我想要了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.74,0:53:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我们来做爱吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.87,0:53:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}换个姿势吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.15,0:53:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要离开\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.76,0:53:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要开始了吗  要进去小穴了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.66,0:53:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我坐在肉棒上蹭好吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.14,0:53:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就是这样\N
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.70,0:53:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好爽\N
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.66,0:54:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样会痛吗   不会的 这样很舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.46,0:54:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你好厉害啊  我觉得好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.49,0:54:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.46,0:54:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我觉得我好幸福 可以和你这样性感的美女做爱\N
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.59,0:54:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}觉得很满足啦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.10,0:54:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很幸福\N
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.26,0:54:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我忍不住了  我好想要\N
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.26,0:55:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}欸  你直接把丝袜撕破啦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.42,0:55:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我不管了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.36,0:55:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要开始了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.46,0:55:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要开始了吗  不用套套吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.46,0:55:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要直接进去吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.73,0:55:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.27,0:56:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我们换个姿势吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.91,0:56:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.47,0:56:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你穿丝袜好性感\N
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.58,0:57:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.07,0:57:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好紧哟...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.78,0:57:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好爽...\N
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.27,0:58:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你的小穴太销魂了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.50,0:58:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我真幸运\N
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.50,0:58:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能和这么美的模特做爱，而且还可以和她交往。\N
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.70,0:58:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天 她把我叫到她的摄影现场来了。\N
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.27,0:58:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}从后面干感觉爽吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.53,0:59:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这感觉是我一生中最棒的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.27,0:59:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}让我难以忘怀是吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.00,0:59:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你来啦\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.33,0:59:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}娜美小姐你好\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.82,0:59:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.50,0:59:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天拍摄工作感觉怎样啊嗯...还挺顺利的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.85,0:59:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要用脚吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.27,0:59:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用脚做的感觉   好棒\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.40,0:59:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我给你带了瓶水 你要喝点吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.47,0:59:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要停  继续   不要停\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.49,0:59:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.15,0:59:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}受不了了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.70,0:59:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}娜美小姐很敬业呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.86,0:59:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的吗\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.44,0:59:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}拍了这么久状态还这么好\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.77,0:59:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}两只脚一起来吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.50,0:59:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}站了很久呢  腿都很累了\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.50,0:59:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真是辛苦你了呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.27,0:59:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}现在腿后跟都觉得痛痛的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.22,0:59:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}既然你觉得累了 那我们现在去做什么呢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.77,1:00:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}磨得很硬了啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.20,1:00:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我们找个地方休息下 腿感觉好酸 我们按摩按摩腿吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.80,1:00:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}找地方休息吗  嗯 找个安静的地方\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.50,1:00:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}安静的地方... 嗯  我腿好累了  ...这样啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.67,1:00:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我受不了了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.30,1:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能走走吗 我们去附近找个地方坐吧我不想走很远啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.47,1:00:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想干我了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.47,1:00:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我想现在就干你  那就快点进来吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.70,1:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}但是这边都没有比较安静的地方呢嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.70,1:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要不我们去楼顶吧 那里都是比较安静的地方 而且我可以帮你按摩\N{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}去楼顶吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.27,1:00:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要进去咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.97,1:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就去那好吗  可以\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.47,1:00:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要小心点哦  小心台阶\N
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.00,1:01:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这里很方便按摩，你就坐在这里可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.73,1:01:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}知道了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.27,1:01:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要准备全力以赴咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.33,1:01:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要让我爽喔\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.50,1:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你好像很累呢\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.34,1:01:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的很累\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.10,1:01:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}哪个部位最辛苦啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.11,1:01:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}应该是小腿吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.30,1:01:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}而且又这么细 当然会很辛苦的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.62,1:01:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那么我来给你按摩吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.39,1:01:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.48,1:01:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要射了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.90,1:01:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样按可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.50,1:01:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就是这里了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.40,1:02:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个...我有个请求\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.06,1:02:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}什么\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.01,1:02:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能让我抚摸你的腿吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.48,1:02:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}射出来了这么多\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.56,1:02:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}为什么\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.31,1:02:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这也是为了更好的按摩啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.48,1:02:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}感觉怎样啊  嗯  还挺舒服的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.77,1:02:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那样的话 好吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.48,1:02:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}主要是你太紧了  嗯嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.31,1:02:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你的腿好长啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.91,1:02:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}大腿也很疲惫吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.85,1:02:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}按这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.48,1:03:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}如果可以的话 请和我交往吧 我是认真的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.01,1:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我能按一按你的大腿吗就一会儿\N
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.48,1:03:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}现在说不知道合不合适\N
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.44,1:03:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就一会儿哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.56,1:03:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我考虑考虑\N
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.91,1:03:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我明白了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.31,1:03:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那么我等你的答复\N
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.10,1:04:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我能按摩你的大腿根部吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.36,1:04:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}根部吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.66,1:04:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}等等  还是先把大腿按完了吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.51,1:04:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}对...对不起\N
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.89,1:04:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你的脚底应该也很酸吧，把靴子脱下来吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.77,1:04:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你要帮我按摩脚吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.87,1:04:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}让我帮你按吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.71,1:06:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以按摩大腿根了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.76,1:06:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.33,1:06:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那么我就失礼了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.51,1:07:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个…我可以用脸在这里磨蹭吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.81,1:07:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以\N
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.51,1:07:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好软   好温暖啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.52,1:07:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那么 接下来 用手指按中间的地方\N
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.52,1:07:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}像这样按吗 嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.72,1:08:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样按感觉还可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.99,1:08:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用点力气按啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.72,1:08:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就是这样\N
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.99,1:08:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}来\N
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.96,1:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}把手伸进连裤袜里按\N
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.76,1:08:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.81,1:10:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就是这样 你好会弄啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.81,1:10:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}加快咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.52,1:10:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那个…其实我的脚经常会浮肿很难受\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.30,1:10:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}所以随身携带了按摩用具\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.94,1:10:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.63,1:10:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}拿来用吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.07,1:10:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.52,1:11:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那...那里可能会被别人看见，来这边吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.82,1:11:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.00,1:11:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这里应该就不会被看见了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.32,1:11:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这就是我的按摩工具了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.36,1:11:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}看来是样不错的东西哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.79,1:11:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}从哪里开始呢\N
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.54,1:11:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}从下面吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.87,1:12:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}感觉怎样\N
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.91,1:12:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.73,1:12:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}感觉哪里最舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.02,1:12:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.53,1:13:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}过来，正对着小穴，贴紧点\N
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.23,1:13:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}喜欢频率低点还是高点啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.40,1:13:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}高的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.53,1:14:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}把我的裤袜脱下来吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.63,1:15:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}如何能看见我的裸脚 很幸福吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.30,1:15:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很幸福\N
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.13,1:15:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}强度还可以吗    还可以\N
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.53,1:16:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么样  很舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.53,1:16:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.50,1:16:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我想直接来\N
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.53,1:17:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要丢了...\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.73,1:18:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你真厉害\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.36,1:18:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.93,1:18:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}刚才爽够了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.58,1:18:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我会继续努力的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.88,1:18:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}快把我的丝袜拿来\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.96,1:18:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不好意思\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.54,1:18:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我怠慢了 真是不好意思\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.74,1:18:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我的腿美吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.33,1:18:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很漂亮\N
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.24,1:18:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天总算实现了夙愿。她叫我去她家里。\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.24,1:19:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}澡洗的舒服吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.12,1:19:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很清爽\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.54,1:19:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}房间真不错\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.96,1:19:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}收拾得这么干净\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.80,1:19:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你很喜欢打扫房间啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.83,1:19:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}一直是这样的吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.84,1:19:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}一直都是\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.94,1:19:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你能坐到这边的床上来吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.68,1:20:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}有话想跟你说\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.61,1:20:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}等下 现在忙着呢\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.54,1:20:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那我去你那边\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.37,1:20:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}来吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.54,1:20:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你靠的太近了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.03,1:20:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你讨厌我吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.54,1:20:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.25,1:20:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没...没什么\N
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.54,1:20:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}看到你我就忍不住\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.41,1:21:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想靠近你\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.14,1:21:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要这样\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.34,1:21:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就要\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.54,1:21:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我已经忍不住了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.24,1:21:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}等等\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.40,1:21:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我等不及了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.75,1:21:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}叫你住手啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.61,1:21:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我就摸一摸\N
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.25,1:21:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就今天给我特别优待吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.55,1:22:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好啦 不要弄啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.31,1:22:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.27,1:22:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}偶尔也让我…\N
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.55,1:22:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我忍不住了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.29,1:22:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你这是干什么啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.55,1:22:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要舔咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.14,1:22:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.25,1:23:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我好心让你来我家 你怎么可以对我做这些事\N
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.31,1:23:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我知道...但是我真的忍不住啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.55,1:23:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我们来做爱 好吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.99,1:23:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行\N
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.01,1:23:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}来做吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.55,1:23:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}为什么...你为什么不好好配和我\N
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.22,1:23:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault} 我不要啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.85,1:24:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我下面都硬了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.04,1:24:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就让我做一次嘛\N
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.68,1:24:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要摸\N
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.55,1:24:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你又想干什么啊 说了不要啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.55,1:24:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的不要吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.71,1:24:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault} 就今天  让我做一次不可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.55,1:24:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}说了住手啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.85,1:25:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.09,1:25:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我不会住手的！\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.38,1:25:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不许再弄了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.55,1:25:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行   叫你不要在弄了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.07,1:25:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我不会住手的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.55,1:25:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再这样的话就请你回去吧！\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.01,1:25:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就算我求你了好吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.38,1:25:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.55,1:25:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不要\N
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.67,1:25:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的不要吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.55,1:26:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}等下会很舒服的哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.00,1:26:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我不要\N
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.25,1:26:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}小穴湿湿的哟\N
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.51,1:26:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嘴上说不要\N
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.20,1:26:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可下面却湿了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.25,1:26:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你其实并不是真的讨厌  对吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.55,1:27:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}转过身来 把屁股对着我这边\N
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.55,1:27:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}看见你的肛毛了哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.56,1:27:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你现在什么感觉\N
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.93,1:27:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好难为情\N
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.47,1:27:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}但是你并不讨厌对吧。我来帮你舔一舔\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.56,1:28:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.56,1:28:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你可真够敏感的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.76,1:28:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要拨开内裤咯 要看见你羞耻的地方了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.56,1:28:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}等等  你先把灯关了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.77,1:28:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不行  就这样继续\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.03,1:28:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}能看得见的话我会更加兴奋\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.89,1:28:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}把你的下面给我看\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.01,1:28:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}拜托不要 太难为情了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.84,1:28:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}没关系的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.56,1:28:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要拉起来咯 让我好好看看\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.50,1:28:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你先把灯关上\N
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.66,1:28:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那你就好好求我\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.14,1:29:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}平时都是我在求你\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.26,1:29:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那就这样做吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.07,1:29:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那你求我啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.26,1:29:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}求求你了 把灯关上吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.73,1:29:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再说一遍\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.36,1:29:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请把灯关上\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.76,1:29:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还是不关了 我就要这样\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.86,1:29:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还是把灯关上吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.12,1:29:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}关灯的话我就可以看你难为情的地方了吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.36,1:29:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}现在可以了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.17,1:29:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要看你那里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.87,1:30:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}看见了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.57,1:30:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}全看见了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.39,1:30:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}感觉如何\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.44,1:30:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}难为情吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.49,1:30:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}难为情…\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.56,1:30:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}说 请您看个够\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.64,1:30:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不说我就不弄咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.04,1:30:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}说啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.68,1:30:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请看个够\N
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.07,1:30:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那我不客气了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.77,1:31:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}说 请您玩我这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.50,1:31:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好好说请您玩我这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.93,1:31:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请玩我这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.31,1:31:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再一遍\N
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.64,1:31:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请玩我这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.77,1:31:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}已经湿糊糊的了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.57,1:32:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你往里面坐 向后靠\N
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.29,1:32:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}把腿打开让我看清楚\N
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.88,1:32:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好棒\N
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.57,1:32:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}给我看你的奶子\N
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.08,1:33:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}给我看你的奶子\N
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.13,1:33:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}自己捏奶子  捏给我看\N
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.57,1:33:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault} 好好地揉哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.07,1:33:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你好像很喜欢这样啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.22,1:33:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很喜欢吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.97,1:34:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这有一双连裤袜\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.90,1:34:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要用它来蒙住你的眼睛\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.58,1:34:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想要吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.77,1:34:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想要就说啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.53,1:34:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}拜托我\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.57,1:34:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请蒙住我的眼睛\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.77,1:34:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再说一次\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.63,1:34:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请蒙住我的眼睛\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.47,1:34:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那我就蒙了哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.07,1:34:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}看不见很害怕吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.17,1:34:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}但是你很喜欢这样吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.37,1:34:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}知道我现在在做什么吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.38,1:34:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}在脱裤子\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.07,1:34:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}猜对了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.15,1:34:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用手摸摸\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.16,1:35:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这是什么\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.63,1:35:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你现在在摸的这个\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.02,1:35:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}肉棒\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.52,1:35:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}确定吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.85,1:35:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是肉棒\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.76,1:35:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好淫荡\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.94,1:35:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}它有什么变化\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.19,1:35:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}硬起来了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.58,1:35:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要用它蹭你\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.16,1:35:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}不许退缩\N
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.91,1:36:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}今天可得让我高兴高兴\N
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.48,1:36:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要在你身上蹭个够\N
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.78,1:36:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用脚夹我这里\N
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.89,1:36:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好爽\N
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.74,1:36:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用脚帮我撸\N
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.79,1:37:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我看不见…\N
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.31,1:37:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}就是这样\N
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.28,1:37:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}把手伸过来，我要绑住你的手\N
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.35,1:37:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你没意见吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.21,1:37:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}告诉我\N
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.68,1:37:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你很兴奋\N
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.54,1:38:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我很兴奋\N
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.61,1:38:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真淫荡啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.42,1:38:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你现在已经是任我摆布了 先用脚来帮我弄\N
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.71,1:39:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}接下来用嘴给我含\N
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.65,1:39:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}嘴巴张开 我要插进去\N
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.10,1:39:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}含到最里面\N
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.38,1:39:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好吃吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.14,1:40:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}给我仔细舔舔右边  给我舔舒服了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.98,1:40:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用舌头来回地舔\N
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.02,1:40:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想要看我勃起的鸡巴吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.01,1:40:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}看吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.34,1:41:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好厉害\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.11,1:41:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}哪里厉害\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.99,1:41:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}变这么大\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.07,1:41:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用你的舌头让它变更大\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.68,1:41:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}接下来我们互相舔吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.83,1:41:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你趴到我身上来\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.87,1:41:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我给你解绑吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.68,1:42:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}给你松开了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.67,1:42:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你含我肉棒  我舔你小穴\N
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.28,1:42:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想要了吗 嗯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.28,1:42:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那就求我吧 求求你 来干我吧\N{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再说一遍 求求你来干我\N
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.48,1:42:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}说请用大肉棒干我 请你干我吧 那我要上咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.58,1:43:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}躺下来  我要躺着做\N
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.58,1:43:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}你很想要了对吧嗯 要什么肉棒\N
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.58,1:43:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要大肉棒不好 来干我嘛\N
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.74,1:43:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}先给你来点有趣的吧  然后我再干你\N
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.49,1:43:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}看 就是这个\N
Dialogue: 0,1:43:49.29,1:43:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}一根肉棒一样的东西\N
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.63,1:44:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要用它来弄你\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.67,1:44:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}把它想象成我的肉棒\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.79,1:44:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎么了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.59,1:44:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}自己退出来了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.59,1:44:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}又进去咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.24,1:44:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这回放深一点  还会出来吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.39,1:44:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}把它挤出来\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.23,1:44:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}用力\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.79,1:44:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}它出来了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.00,1:44:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样舒服吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.90,1:44:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好厉害...\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.21,1:44:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}全部进去了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.59,1:44:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}肉棒插得可深了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.40,1:45:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要你的肉棒\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.14,1:45:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}自己把火腿肠塞进小穴\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.51,1:45:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}然后再把它挤出来\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.92,1:45:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}做两遍给我看\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.08,1:45:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要换我的大肉棒上咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.25,1:45:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要进去咯\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.13,1:45:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}怎样\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.21,1:45:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.30,1:45:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我也很舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.49,1:46:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再说一次\N
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.72,1:46:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}是不是很舒服啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.97,1:46:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很舒服\N
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.07,1:46:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}换个姿势吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.69,1:46:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我喜欢从后面干你\N
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.59,1:47:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}穿上你的丝袜\N
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.93,1:47:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我要你穿上丝袜  然后好好干你\N
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.56,1:47:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}明白了吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.47,1:47:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}都听你的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.37,1:47:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}快点哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.09,1:48:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.21,1:48:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}这样就可以了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.43,1:48:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}小穴好紧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.59,1:49:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}爽不爽啊\N
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.16,1:49:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}往前面趴一下 我要撕开一点你的丝袜\N
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.04,1:49:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}现在好了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.03,1:49:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}再动快点\N
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.79,1:50:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好厉害\N
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.10,1:50:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}干得你爽不爽\N
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.52,1:50:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}好爽\N
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.89,1:50:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那我们加快点更爽\N
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.30,1:50:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}有点痛...  这体位把我弄疼了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.70,1:50:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}还是躺下来吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.06,1:51:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}很喜欢吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.51,1:52:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}做爱很舒服吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.68,1:52:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我想要射了 可以吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.21,1:52:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}射在里面也行吗.\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.15,1:52:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}想射哪都行\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.30,1:52:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}哪怕会怀上小孩也没事吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.48,1:52:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以的\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.30,1:52:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我真的要射进去了哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.76,1:52:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以啦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.17,1:52:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}那么你说 请射在我里面\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.83,1:52:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}请射在我里面\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.60,1:52:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}真的吗  我要射了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.80,1:52:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}要射了...\N
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.30,1:52:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}射进去了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.07,1:53:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}全都射进去了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.19,1:53:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}感觉如何\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.16,1:53:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}太舒服了\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.43,1:53:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}射在里面真的没关系吗\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.96,1:53:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我这样做你不会讨厌我吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.42,1:53:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}我偶尔也像这样粗暴地对待你也可以吧\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.62,1:53:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}可以哦\N
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.27,1:53:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\rDefault}太好了！真的是超爽。\N

